<metadata><name>Galičica trail MTB-3</name><desc>MTB-3 is one of Galičica National Park's mountain bike trails, several of which link the hiking routes. It runs 7.3 km from the MTB-2 junction to the MTB-2 junction, climbing about 145 m and descending 152 m in the direction drawn, between 1,438 m and 1,559 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/mtb-3/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
